    "title": "ampm",
    "description": "Like saving money? Good. With the ampm app, you\u2019ll save on app only deals and get rewarded with incredible Bonus Deals on your favorite stuff. It\u2019s our way of saying \u201cthanks\u201d for making ampm the place you trust for great quality and incredible value. \r\n\r\nGET DEALS YOU\u2019LL LOVE\r\nEnjoy app only deals that can save you extra money every time you visit an ampm. There are even special Bonus Deals that give you the chance to unlock big prizes. Oh. And you\u2019ll probably want to be on the lookout for Flash Deals\u2026 but be quick, they are only available for a limited time! \r\n\r\nCLUBS SAVE YOU EVEN MORE MONEY\r\nIt\u2019s like a digital punch card. You buy the stuff you love. We\u2019ll track how many in the app. When you\u2019ve bought enough, you get a free one. That\u2019s easy enough, right?\r\n\r\nSCRATCH AND WIN GAME\r\nPlay Scratch Power for a chance to win FREE stuff. Over 50,000 prizes are available every month! Want more chances to win? Get rewarded with 1 Scratcher for every *$1 you spend (so be sure to scan your barcode every time you visit) and get 1 additional Scratcher every day you check-in to an ampm. \r\n*excludes fuel, propane, lottery and car washes.\r\n\r\nWIN THE WEEKLY GRAND PRIZE \u2013 LIKE A $500 PUMP PASS!\r\nWith ampm, you can win big! Scan your barcode every time you make a purchase for an entry to win a weekly grand prize like a $500 Pump Pass. The more you scan, the more chances you have to win! \r\n\r\nINVITE YOUR FRIENDS\r\nInvite your friends to join the app and you both get rewarded. Each time someone signs up with your personal invite code and makes their first purchase, you\u2019ll both get a special reward.\r\n\r\nFIND A STORE\r\nWhen you\u2019re craving a snack, use the handy Store Locator to find an ampm near you. Looking for something specific? Easily get each store\u2019s location and all the ampm amenities that are available such as beer, hot foods, fresh bakery, cold deli, fountain drinks and car wash.\r\n\r\nHOW IT WORKS\r\nGet great deals, rewards and prizes in a few easy steps! \r\n1.\tDownload the ampm app.\r\n2.\tRegister your account using your email, mobile number or existing social login.\r\n3.\tCheck-in daily or make a purchase to get rewarded with Scratchers to play Scratch Power.\r\n4.\tScan your barcode every time you shop to maximize your savings. \r\n\r\nJOIN NOW\r\nWhat are you waiting for? We\u2019ve got something you need or crave with your name on it. Download the ampm app now and start saving!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Like saving money? Good. With the ampm app, you\u2019ll save on app only deals and get rewarded with incredible Bonus Deals on your favorite stuff. It\u2019s our way of saying \u201cthanks\u201d for making ampm the place you trust for great quality and incredible value. <br><br>GET DEALS YOU\u2019LL LOVE<br>Enjoy app only deals that can save you extra money every time you visit an ampm. There are even special Bonus Deals that give you the chance to unlock big prizes. Oh. And you\u2019ll probably want to be on the lookout for Flash Deals\u2026 but be quick, they are only available for a limited time! <br><br>CLUBS SAVE YOU EVEN MORE MONEY<br>It\u2019s like a digital punch card. You buy the stuff you love. We\u2019ll track how many in the app. When you\u2019ve bought enough, you get a free one. That\u2019s easy enough, right?<br><br>SCRATCH AND WIN GAME<br>Play Scratch Power for a chance to win FREE stuff. Over 50,000 prizes are available every month! Want more chances to win? Get rewarded with 1 Scratcher for every *$1 you spend (so be sure to scan your barcode every time you visit) and get 1 additional Scratcher every day you check-in to an ampm. <br>*excludes fuel, propane, lottery and car washes.<br><br>WIN THE WEEKLY GRAND PRIZE \u2013 LIKE A $500 PUMP PASS!<br>With ampm, you can win big! Scan your barcode every time you make a purchase for an entry to win a weekly grand prize like a $500 Pump Pass. The more you scan, the more chances you have to win! <br><br>INVITE YOUR FRIENDS<br>Invite your friends to join the app and you both get rewarded. Each time someone signs up with your personal invite code and makes their first purchase, you\u2019ll both get a special reward.<br><br>FIND A STORE<br>When you\u2019re craving a snack, use the handy Store Locator to find an ampm near you. Looking for something specific? Easily get each store\u2019s location and all the ampm amenities that are available such as beer, hot foods, fresh bakery, cold del